              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manuka wicare mu mukungugu, wa nkumi y’i Babuloni; wa mukobga w’Abakaludaya, icara hasi hatari ku ntebe y’ubgami, kuk’ utazokwongera kuvugwa k’udibamye canke ko wāmikaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 16:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fata urusyo usye, utwikurure mu maso hawe; kūra imvune zawe, ukūre impuzu ushitse mu bibero, ujabuke inzūzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubgambure bgawe buzotwikururwa, mber’ ibiteye isoni vyawe bizoboneka; nzokwīhōra, kandi sinzogira akagongwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni k’Umucunguzi wacu agize, izina ryiwe n’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, Uwera w’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icara wumaniwe, wibembeteranye mu mwiza, wa mukobga w’ Abakaludaya we, kuk’ utazokwongera kwitwa Umugabekazi w’ibihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 14:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "51:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nari narakiye abantu banje, mpindura igihumane ishamvu yanje, ndabakugomorera; nawe nta kagongwe wabagiriye, abatāma wabatwaje amanyama birengeje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urīyāga, uti Nzoba umugabekazi ibihe bidashira. Ivyo ntiwarushe ubishirak’ umutima, canke ngo wibuke iherezo ryavyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
